  "description": "Prometheus-backed DCGM dashboard for XID coverage/events, ECC faults, HBM capacity/temperature, and GPU clock health. An empty XID coverage panel means the exporter is not publishing DCGM_FI_DEV_XID_ERRORS; it must not be interpreted as zero XIDs.",
